WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:33.990
I'm Babbit.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.110
I am too.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:36.070
Babbit.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.110
Babbit.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:39.950
It's pointless if all of us are
Babbit.

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:43.410
The trip to New York has finally
come to an end.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.410
Let's look at the pictures again.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:46.790
Sicil...

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:49.790
Sicil...

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.840
That was a special report from New York.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.720
Those were just your pictures,
what's the report?

00:01:55.670 --> 00:02:00.140
Hello, Good Bye,
My Love

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.310
Asako, good morning.

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.060
Asako, good morning.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.810
Asako,
remember to brush your teeth.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:08.140
Asako, be sure to have breakfast.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:09.850
Asako, Asako, it's you.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:11.560
Asako, I love you.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.230
Asako, I need you.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.780
Rei-kun, what are you doing?

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.240
Ah!

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.700
Why are you two still awake?

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.070
All you chattering kept us awake.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.450
It's Cat's mail.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.740
I'm making Rei-kun's love message
collection for my Asako.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.920
When you get back to Japan, you
can talk to her as much as you want.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:31.830
I don't think so.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:36.300
I received our work schedule in
New York.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.260
See?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.970
Wow... It's full.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.760
I already refused more then half
of the offers.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.640
All of this is you and
Naozumi-kun's work schedules.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:49.100
Then after we get back to Japan, we'll be together for a while, Nao-pyang.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.560
That's right... eh, Sana-pi...

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:54.110
You don't have to pretend like his.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.570
Why are you laughing like
Tamo-chan suddenly?

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:00.280
I suddenly remembered our
first time.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.070
What first time?

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.410
How we met, the first time.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.620
Let's all watch how it happened.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.200
I know your secret.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.880
Ah, don't look at me like that.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.920
You were a weirdo back then,
Nao-pyang.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:22.550
But that Naozumi-kun is sitting
beside me right now.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.180
Fate is a really strange thing.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:29.770
I can't believe we went to New York together, and had that disgusting food for so long.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.270
You were eating
it with everyone else.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.600
Let's run away...

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.400
...together.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.150
Let's run away...

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.820
...together.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.530
Run away?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.490
Let's run away...

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.410
...together.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.460
We finally pulled through.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:56.000
Yeah, after everything that
happened in New York...

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:00.840
...the things that happened in
Japan seem so long ago.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.630
I'm Kurata Sana.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.890
Today, I'm gonna become a Jinbo
middle school first year student.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:07.430
I'm attending an escalator school where

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:11.730
most kids come from its own elementary school so the student makeup is about the same.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:15.150
But about a third of the students
will be coming from other schools.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.650
Because of this, I think I can
make a lot of new friends.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.280
Can I use some of that mousse?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.570
Sure.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:24.450
Thank you.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.240
Kansai-ben (accent from Osaka)...

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.280
The person who I met in the
bathroom, Fuka!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.450
She's my best friend.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.710
Hayama!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.750
Meet my friend, Matsui Fuka-chan.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.380
Here's Hayama!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.170
How do you do.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.470
How strange, this woman

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:51.100
Because of you...

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.690
Because of you my life became
really screwed up!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.020
Hey Aki, listen, listen!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:01.320
Yunchi's mom and dad kissed
yesterday!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.820
Are you guys stupid?

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.400
Kissing between couples is normal.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.910
Aki, so have you kissed anyone
before?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.910
No, but I could do it.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.790
No way!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.000
So if I do it, you'll give me
10 yen each?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.210
Sure, but I bet you can't do it!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.790
Buka, Buka.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.090
My name is not Buka, it's Fuka!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.880
Who cares, just come.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.970
- Aki, where are we going?
- Don't worry about it.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.980
I already liked someone then.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.190
Takaishi-kun was in the same
class as me.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.690
We got along really well with
each other.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.940
I was waiting for him to
tell me that he liked me.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:48.320
Back then I had a life plan!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.450
Fuka's
beautiful life

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.700
Matsui Fuka! Begin timing!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.580
Elementary school graduation,
Takaishi tells me he likes me.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.370
11 years old, we go out.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.420
12 years old,
we kiss for the first time.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:02.460
23 years old, I quit work and get
married at the palace.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.970
But then Aki messed this all up!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:11.100
Um... because
this girl is your fan...

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.510
...she wants to take a picture
with you,

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.060
is that okay?

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.980
I'm sorry.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:20.190
Eh, why not?
What harm is there in one picture?

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.570
She's really liked you ever
since school started.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:27.950
I don't even know this girl, and to think she will have a picture of her and me...

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.450
It disgusts me.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.490
Who does he think he is?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:37.460
If you're gonna refuse, why can't
you be a little nicer?

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.420
That poor girl is crying!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:40.630
Shut up!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:44.340
If I'm nice to someone I don't like, I don't feel like that's truly being nice.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:50.380
He... with this looks, he's not
just another annoying guy.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.850
That Hayama.
He makes a lot of sense. He's cool...

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.520
...and... interesting.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.190
Cool?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.400
Interesting?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:12.530
These kinds of things, I've never
thought about them before.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.330
Never, never.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.410
Hiroto played by

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.410
Kamura Naozumi (13)

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.790
Hiroto played by Kamura Naozumi.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.700
My heart is on fire!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.880
I won't be upstaged by Sana-chan's
talent! I'm going to do my best!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.630
Mako played by

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.630
Kurata Sana (12)

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.630
Mako played Kurata Sana.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:31.090
I've been trying to empty my head
so that I can think about what a ghost feels.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.260
But it was empty to begin with so
I didn't have to bother.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.350
I'm putting a lot of energy into this work.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.140
Almost all the scenes are on location.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:42.060
When the set is ready, we're going on location in the mountains

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.770
where there isn't any electricity.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.110
How long will that be?

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:48.110
About two months,
maybe longer.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.240
Akito-kun, you love Sana-chan,
don't you?

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:55.160
You should tell her
before she leaves.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.120
You won't be able to see her
for two months...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.580
...and she will be with
Naozumi-kun all the time.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:08.710
That's... Hayama...

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.590
Excuse me, please stop the bus
for a second!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.800
Kurata.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.180
What is it?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.390
I have something to tell you.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.430
What do you want to tell me?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.020
I can't say it here.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.110
I'll tell you when you get back.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.860
Ok, I got it.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.650
You'll tell me when I get back, right?

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.030
It's only three months anyway.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.490
I'll look forward to hearing it,
Hayama.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.070
Ah... Excuse me.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:23.200
Is Nakaga-san's mansion here
somewhere?

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.580
I'm looking for my brother.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.960
Guest...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.230
Welcome.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.150
What?

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.820
What, what do you want,
Naozumi-kun?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.450
That scene, Hiroto...

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.500
No me... lt was real.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:11.420
I'm really... starting to...

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.930
...love you.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.350
Will you be... my real boyfriend?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:32.940
Hayama! It's me, it's me!
Are you doing well?

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.320
You could say that...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.320
Right now it's break time.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.700
The phone somehow works and I got
through to you.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.530
Hey! Are you listening?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:41.570
Yeah.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.870
You said you wanted to tell me
something.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.000
What was it about?

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.620
What was it?

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.460
Tell me what it was!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.630
Actually...

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.380
It's over.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.380
What do you mean?

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.890
Now I'm dating Fuka.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.330
Naozumi-kun...

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.160
I can't stop thinking about you,
Sana-chan.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:29.710
No! Not someone bad like me!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.210
Sana-chan...

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.170
I never knew you were like this.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.840
It seems that I got turned down.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:41.970
Sorry, Naozumi-kun, but when I think
about you I say something very heartless.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:45.050
But I'm too occupied with myself.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:47.180
My mind is all messed up.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.730
I never knew I was such
a weakling.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.850
Really... enough...

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.990
Why? Why are you crying?

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.660
Because you're crying, Sana-chan.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.950
Me?

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:06.370
For you Sana-chan...

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.370
...I can do anything.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:14.380
Hurts...

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.590
Anything...
even if you love someone else.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.470
Naozumi-kun...

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.510
I'll always be there for you
Sana-chan!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:28.350
So don't cry, don't cry.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.480
Naozumi...

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.820
If you ever feel like crying...

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.530
If you ever feel like crying,
come to me.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.000
I'm sorry.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.540
I'm sorry, Naozumi-kun.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:06.590
I'm sorry.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.330
When I realize I like him,

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.130
I get turned down.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.670
When you make me cry,

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.670
what am I supposed to do?

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:53.930
{parte b}

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:54.060
Babbit's Picture Song

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:51.310
A bulging triangle, drop some water onto the heart, then add some wings.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.350
And that's how you draw Babbit.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.980
The filming of the movie Water Palace ended.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.070
Finally, back at school!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.910
So nervous...

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.710
Yo, Fuka!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.250
Sana, you're back!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.340
I haven't seen you in ages!
When did you get back?

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:27.010
I came back during summer vacation.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.590
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.390
Hayama...

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:37.020
Keep cool, keep cool, keep cool,
keep cool...

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.570
Scary growing machine.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.730
Do you look up to me?

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.730
As in admire.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:46.900
Look up to me.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.740
Look up to...

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.070
There's nothing to look up to.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.120
Because there's
nothing there at all.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.540
Heh... Why's that?

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.500
Why did I just do that?

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.340
School life is even more intense
than work!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.720
It seems...

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:12.090
I feel as if there's a wall
between us.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.310
Because both of you are couples...

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.310
...l'm the only one who's single.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.640
What are you saying?

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:22.100
Sana, you're looking into things.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.360
Wait a sec, what do you mean?

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.440
Not again,
you're still pretending...

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:30.400
You've already made a love
declaration with Kamura-kun.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:35.950
That... did you all believe that it
was true?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.080
It's a lie!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.710
- A lie?
- How?

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:45.170
But even if it is a lie, how come
there are so many articles about it?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.960
You didn't find out the truth
from me...

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:52.470
...you all trusted the press and
Ishida-kun instead, didn't you?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.470
Sana-chan...

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.930
This...

00:15:55.930 --> 00:16:00.060
But back then we had to believe it...

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.980
You and Kamura-kun get
along very well, right?

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:06.770
Of course we get along well!
We're friends!

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:09.530
Damn, my tears are coming out.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:15.490
Sorry, everyone.
I'm going home now.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.290
Sana-chan...

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.120
Aki!

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.890
Is this worth getting upset over?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.970
Enough! Mind your own business!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.470
That's no good, Sana.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.770
Sana...

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.570
I don't know what's going on.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.030
Tell me the truth!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:56.320
I have to hear it from you...
I'll only believe you!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.910
The truth?

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.250
Then...

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.250
Will you tell me the truth?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:11.090
Do you really love me?

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:14.010
I've always loved you! But...

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.640
I just never said it.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:26.020
Fu... Fuka...

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:32.990
I was wondering what took you so long so I came to check...

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.490
I won't break up!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.910
Fuka!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.920
Hi, Hayama.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.630
Did you just have Karate practice?
You're working pretty hard.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:56.550
Well, I want to apologize for last
time... I said strange things.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.510
We won't be seeing each other much
in the future,

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.310
so I came to say goodbye.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:04.270
I'm going to concentrate on my
acting career.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.020
And I'm sure that...

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:09.860
I'll find a good man soon.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.650
Yes.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:13.730
Really, you're in the past.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:15.940
Past?

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.950
That's right, in the past.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:23.660
So please tell Fuka to forget
about it all.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.200
I'm sorry.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.120
I...

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:33.340
I just can't drop Fuka like that.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.340
Of course.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.590
It goes without saying, Hayama.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.600
Well,

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.890
I have to go. Stay strong!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.610
Hayama!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.940
If only time could stop...

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:01.870
I don't want any past...
or future...

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.830
Just this moment... I just want to
stay like this forever!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.710
But I...

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.590
Bye-bye...

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:19.720
Hayama.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:04.680
Sana!

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:38.210
Hayama... has chosen Fuka...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.680
I finally pulled through.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:56.940
All thanks to Naozumi-kun.

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:01.940
Whether in Japan or in New York,
we fought everything together.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.860
Naozumi-kun...

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:06.110
You fell asleep?

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.870
What?!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.910
What's wrong, Rei-kun?
Why aren't you sleeping?

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.500
We're doomed...

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.790
We forget about him.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.840
Maeda-san!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.960
I wonder when I can get back.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.470
I really want to go back to
Japan soon.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:26.720
What are we going to do?!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:27.930
D-don't worry about it.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.680
He's an adult.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.890
I'm sure he can get back by himself.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:34.640
Th... that's true.
Right... Right?

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:39.150
The plane is now on top of Hawaii, we can not go back New York.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.650
Aloha, Hawaii...

